ested for showing deepfake AI video of people breaking into police car to a cop]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130244177.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-man-arrested-for-showing-deepfake-ai-video-of-people-breaking-into-police-car-to-a-cop-held-on-7000-bond/articleshow/130244177.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/florida-man-arrested-for-showing-deepfake-ai-video-of-people-breaking-into-police-car-to-a-cop-held-on-7000-bond/articleshow/130244177.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-14T00:12:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130244177,imgsize-106796.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[1,000 Roman objects were found in Lake Switzerland, and they are almost perfectly preserved]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130243987.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/1000-roman-objects-were-found-in-lake-switzerland-and-they-are-almost-perfectly-preserved/articleshow/130243987.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/1000-roman-objects-were-found-in-lake-switzerland-and-they-are-almost-perfectly-preserved/articleshow/130243987.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-14T01:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130244049,imgsize-86202.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jeff Bezos’ Blue Origin extracts oxygen from Moon dust in a breakthrough for long-term human life on Moon]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130243936.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Blue Origin has successfully extracted oxygen from Moon-like soil in lab tests, a significant step for sustained lunar presence. This molten regolith electrolysis technique could drastically cut reliance on Earth supplies. The process, which also yields useful metals for construction, addresses a key challenge for future long-term human missions beyond our planet.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/jeff-bezos-blue-origin-extracts-oxygen-from-moon-dust-in-a-breakthrough-for-long-term-human-life-on-moon/articleshow/130243936.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/jeff-bezos-blue-origin-extracts-oxygen-from-moon-dust-in-a-breakthrough-for-long-term-human-life-on-moon/articleshow/130243936.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-14T00:10:07+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130244097,imgsize-948214.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian student missing in US since 2019: FBI's social media post on Mayushi Bhagat sparks confusion]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130242959.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-student-missing-in-us-since-2019-fbis-social-media-post-on-mayushi-bhagat-sparks-confusion/articleshow/130242959.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/indian-student-missing-in-us-since-2019-fbis-social-media-post-on-mayushi-bhagat-sparks-confusion/articleshow/130242959.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-13T23:01:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/